            "review_title": "Review at Arigato Sushi",
            "review_text": "PeacefulSequoia\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam150 contributions\n0\nConsistently outstanding sushi at incredible prices\nSep 2020 • Family\nWe’ve been enjoying delicious Arigato Sushi for 4 years now. Favorites are C1, C6 and the Futoritos (sushi burritos). It’s literally some of the best sushi we’ve ever had, including in Japan. \n\nYou can feed the whole family for about $20, too! Owner is super friendly and accommodating. Arigato is simply fantastic! \n\nNOTE: As of September 2020, they have a new address. The address in TripAdvisor wasn’t correct at the time of this review. The are now located in The Bloq restaurant “pod” at 19 Tran Ngoc Dien, District 2, Ho Chi Minh City, as reflected by Google, too.\nRead more\nWritten September 7, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
